k the authors of open source libraries used in Las Notes:<br>• <a href=\"https://github.com/gonzalezreal/swift-markdown-ui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Swift Markdown UI</a><br>• <a href=\"https://github.com/whistyun/MdXaml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MdXaml</a><br>• <a href=\"https://github.com/stephencelis/SQLite.swift\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SQLite.swift</a><br>• <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/standard/data/sqlite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MS.Data.Sqlite</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/column {\"id\":2,\"borderWidth\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"uniqueID\":\"21_aff1a0-fd\",\"kbVersion\":2} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column21_aff1a0-fd\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><!-- wp:kadence/advancedheading {\"uniqueID\":\"21_b3b79c-f5\",\"align\":\"center\",\"color\":\"palette9\",\"fontWeight\":\"normal\",\"margin\":[\"\",null,\"\",null],\"markFontWeight\":\"regular\",\"markBorder\":\"\",\"markBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"tabletMarkBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"mobileMarkBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"colorClass\":\"theme-palette9\",\"fontSize\":[34,null,null]} -->\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading21_b3b79c-f5 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading21_b3b79c-f5\">Current roadmap</h2>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/advancedheading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|theme-palette9\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"theme-palette9\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-theme-palet