rgin\":[\"\",null,\"\",null],\"markFontWeight\":\"regular\",\"markBorder\":\"\",\"markBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"tabletMarkBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"mobileMarkBorderStyles\":[{\"top\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[null,\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"fontSize\":[40,null,null]} -->\n<h2 class=\"kt-adv-heading21_35ad89-cc wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading21_35ad89-cc\">Current roadmap</h2>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/advancedheading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>○ Mobile versions for iOS and Android<br>○ Encryption support<br>○ Images in markdown<br>○ Quick synchronization via Las Notes Cloud.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/rowlayout --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/rowlayout -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/rowlayout {\"uniqueID\":\"21_2aa8ab-82\",\"columns\":4,\"colLayout\":\"equal\",\"bgColor\":\"palette2\",\"topSep\":\"mtns\",\"bgColorClass\":\"theme-palette2\",\"kbVersion\":2} -->\n<!-- wp:kadence/column {\"borderWidth\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"uniqueID\":\"21_e5bacd-77\",\"kbVersion\":2} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column21_e5bacd-77\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Copyright © 2025. Artem Mitrakov</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/column {\"id\":2,\"borderWidth\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"uniqueID\":\"21_6d37ea-0a\",\"kbVersion\":2} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column21_6d37ea-0a\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Support: support@lasnotes.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/col