e-palette-8-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading21_07f210-7d\">Las Notes is an indefinite linear feed of quick notes with Global Search support.<br>Stop creating complex trees of notes with heavy multi-category structure.<br>Just create a new DB file and start adding new quick notes.<br>Then you can search them by tags or by keywords in Global Search.</p>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/advancedheading --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/column {\"borderWidth\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"uniqueID\":\"21_aa556e-0e\",\"kbVersion\":2} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column21_aa556e-0e\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><!-- wp:kadence/advancedbtn {\"uniqueID\":\"21_8a8919-54\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns21_8a8919-54\"><!-- wp:kadence/singlebtn {\"uniqueID\":\"21_d1ff5f-7b\",\"text\":\"Download for Mac\",\"link\":\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/lasnotes-macos-1.0.0.zip\",\"download\":true,\"padding\":[12,32,12,32],\"color\":\"#ffffff\",\"background\":\"palette2\",\"colorHover\":\"palette9\",\"backgroundHover\":\"palette3\",\"borderStyle\":[{\"top\":[\"palette9\",\"solid\",0],\"right\":[\"palette9\",\"solid\",0],\"bottom\":[\"palette9\",\"solid\",0],\"left\":[\"palette9\",\"solid\",0],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"borderHoverStyle\":[{\"top\":[\"rgba(68, 68, 68, 0)\",\"\",\"\"],\"right\":[\"rgba(68, 68, 68, 0)\",\"\",\"\"],\"bottom\":[\"rgba(68, 68, 68, 0)\",\"\",\"\"],\"left\":[\"rgba(68, 68, 68, 0)\",\"\",\"\"],\"unit\":\"px\"}],\"borderRadius\":[50,50,50,50],\"icon\":\"fa_apple\",\"typography\":[{\"size\":[20,\"\",\"\"],\"sizeType\":\"px\",\"lineHeight\":[\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"lineType\":\"\",\"letterSpacing\":[\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"letterType\":\"px\",\"family\":\"\",\"google\":false,\"style\":\"normal\",\"weight\":\"regular\",\"variant\":\"\",\"subset\":\"\",\"textTransform\":\"\",\"loadGoogle\":true}],\"displayShadow\":true,\"shadow\":[{\"color\":\"#000000\",\"opacity\":0.2,\"spread\":0,\"blur\