:\"21_da6616-b8\",\"kbVersion\":2} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column21_da6616-b8\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|theme-palette8\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"theme-palette8\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-theme-palette-8-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><a href=\"https://lasnotes.com/privacy-policy/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"89\">Privacy policy</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->\n<!-- /wp:kadence/rowlayout -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Las Notes','','inherit','closed','closed','','21-revision-v1','','','2025-02-13 13:35:03','2025-02-13 13:35:03','',21,'https://lasnotes.com/?p=91',0,'revision','',0),(92,1,'2025-02-13 13:38:01','2025-02-13 13:38:01','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Privacy Policy</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you require any more information or have any questions about our privacy policy, please feel free to <a href=\"mailto://support@lasnotes.com\">contact us</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This privacy policy document outlines the types of personal information is received and collected by https://lasnotes.com.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A cookie is a small key-value record that is stored on a user\'s computer for record-keeping purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you wish to disable cookies, you may do so through your individual browser options. More detailed information about cookie management with specific web browsers can be found at the browsers\' respective websites.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use only Wordpress cookies created by Wordpress plugins or by the engine itself.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Other personal data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not collect any other personal data except Wordpress cookies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Log Files</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Like many other websites, this website makes use of log files. The information inside the log files includes the client\'s IP address and web-browser\'s User agent information, such as browser details (name, version), OS information (OS name, version, architecture), web engine data (name, version). This data may be used for statistical purposes. Note that IP addresses, and other such information are not lined to any information that is personally identifiable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.tuxpi.com/\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Privacy policy','','inherit','closed','closed','','89-revision-v1','','','2025-02-13 13:38:01','2025-02-13 13:38:01','',89,'https://lasnotes.com/?p=92',0,'revision','',0),(93,1,'2025-02-13 13:39:00','2025-02-13 13:39:00','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Privacy Policy</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you require any more information or have any questions about our privacy policy, please feel free to <a href=\"mailto:support@lasnotes.com\">contact us</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This privacy policy document outlines the types of personal information is received and collected by https://lasnotes.com.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A cookie is a small key-value record that is stored on a user\'s computer for record-keeping purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n